  <ScenTitle>Scenario Editor Tutorial-Adding Weapons, 2015</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;Unlike other Command scenarios, this is intended to be played in the editor. In this, the player will add aircraft to an airfield, arm the aircraft, and then shoot down an easy target.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;NOTE: THIS IS INTENDED TO BE PLAYED IN THE EDITOR. USE "LOAD EXISTING SCENARIO ON THE START MENU" TO ACCESS IT THE RIGHT WAY. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;-Scenario by Coiler12.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
